---@class cloudflare.addressing.ValidatePrefixRequest
---@field account_id string Identifier of a Cloudflare account.
---@field prefix_id string Identifier of an IP Prefix.

---Unwrapped `result` payload of the Cloudflare v4 response envelope.
---@class cloudflare.addressing.ValidatePrefixResponse
---@field id? string|distilled.Null Identifier of an IP Prefix.
---@field account_id? string|distilled.Null Identifier of a Cloudflare account.
---@field advertised? boolean|distilled.Null Prefer the [BGP Prefixes API](https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/addressing/subresources/prefixes/subresources/bgp_prefixes/) instead, which allows for advertising multiple BGP routes within a single IP Prefix.
---@field advertised_modified_at? string|distilled.Null Prefer the [BGP Prefixes API](https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/addressing/subresources/prefixes/subresources/bgp_prefixes/) instead, which allows for advertising multiple BGP routes within a single IP Prefix.
---@field approved? string|distilled.Null Approval state of the prefix (P = pending, V = approved). Approval does not advertise the prefix or activate traffic.
---@field asn? number|distilled.Null Autonomous System Number (ASN) the prefix will be advertised under. Use 13335 for Cloudflare's ASN, or your own ASN as an integer without the AS prefix. The IRR route and RPKI ROA must authorize this ASN.
---@field asn_ownership_validation_state? cloudflare.addressing.ValidatePrefixResponseAsnOwnershipValidationState|distilled.Null State of ASN ownership validation for a customer-owned Autonomous System Number (ASN). Returned when an ASN ownership validation result exists. Omitted when validation does not apply, such as for Cloudflare-owned ASNs. Verification is reused for prefixes with the same account and ASN. Refer to [ASN ownership validation states](https://developers.cloudflare.com/byoip/troubleshooting/prefix-validation/#asn-ownership-validation) for state meanings and resolutions.
---@field aspa_validation_state? cloudflare.addressing.ValidatePrefixResponseAspaValidationState|distilled.Null State of Autonomous System Provider Authorization (ASPA) validation for a customer-owned ASN. Returned when an ASPA validation result exists. Publishing an ASPA is optional. A published ASPA must authorize AS13335 as a provider. An invalid result blocks approval. If omitted, no ASPA validation result is available. Omission does not indicate successful validation or confirm that no ASPA exists. Refer to [ASPA validation states](https://developers.cloudflare.com/byoip/troubleshooting/prefix-validation/#aspa-validation) for state meanings and resolutions, and [ASPA authorization](https://developers.cloudflare.com/byoip/concepts/route-filtering-rpki/#aspa-authorization) for publication guidance.
---@field cidr? string|distilled.Null IP Prefix in Classless Inter-Domain Routing format.
---@field created_at? string|distilled.Null
---@field delegate_loa_creation? boolean|distilled.Null Whether Cloudflare is allowed to generate the LOA document on behalf of the prefix owner.
---@field description? string|distilled.Null Description of the prefix.
---@field irr_validation_state? string|distilled.Null State of one kind of validation for an IP prefix.
---@field loa_document_id? string|distilled.Null Identifier for the uploaded LOA document.
---@field modified_at? string|distilled.Null
---@field on_demand_enabled? boolean|distilled.Null Prefer the [BGP Prefixes API](https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/addressing/subresources/prefixes/subresources/bgp_prefixes/) instead, which allows for advertising multiple BGP routes within a single IP Prefix.
---@field on_demand_locked? boolean|distilled.Null Prefer the [BGP Prefixes API](https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/addressing/subresources/prefixes/subresources/bgp_prefixes/) instead, which allows for advertising multiple BGP routes within a single IP Prefix.
---@field ownership_validation_state? string|distilled.Null State of one kind of validation for an IP prefix.
---@field ownership_validation_token? string|distilled.Null Token used to verify ownership of the prefix and, when applicable, its ASN. Use the same token for both checks. Refer to the [BYOIP onboarding guide](https://developers.cloudflare.com/byoip/get-started/) for verification instructions.
---@field rpki_validation_state? string|distilled.Null State of one kind of validation for an IP prefix.

---@alias cloudflare.addressing.ValidatePrefixResponseAsnOwnershipValidationState "pending"|"valid"|"missing"|"invalid"

---@alias cloudflare.addressing.ValidatePrefixResponseAspaValidationState "pending"|"valid"|"invalid"

